    <bpmn:process id="W_W4449" name="W4449. SCO/Scan-&amp;-Go Loss, Sweethearting &amp; Swap-Fraud Detection" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: SCO operation; loss analytics; exception feed
Frequency: Continuous (analytics) + per case
Volume: SCO loss-rate benchmark 2–5× staffed-POS shrink
Owner: Loss Prevention (VS-23) / Frontend (VS-08) / BI (VS-28)
Participants: LP (VS-23), Frontend (VS-08), BI (VS-28), Security (VS-27.3), HR (VS-103), Store Ops (VS-07)
Source: workflow W4449 — SCO/Scan-&amp;-Go Loss, Sweethearting &amp; Swap-Fraud Detection</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4449_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4449_Lane1" name="LP">
