      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4449_Start3" name="SCO operation; loss analytics; exception feed">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4449_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4449_Task4" name="LP/BI run SCO/scan-&amp;-go loss analytics — scan-avoidance (item not scanned)…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: LP/BI run SCO/scan-&amp;-go loss analytics — scan-avoidance (item not scanned), weight-mismatch rate, barcode-swap (cheap-on-expensive), sweethearting (attendant override pattern), and basket-anomaly detection
Responsible (R): LP / BI
Accountable (A): LP Lead
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4449_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4449_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4449_Task5" name="LP triage high-risk cases, pull CCTV/exception evidence (W4450), distinguish…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: LP triage high-risk cases, pull CCTV/exception evidence (W4450), distinguish customer-fraud from internal-collusion (attendant), and open case (W4450/VS-125)
Responsible (R): LP / Security
Accountable (A): LP Lead
Duration: Per case</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4449_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4449_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4449_Task6" name="LP/Frontend tune the detection rules (W4437), train attendants on…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: LP/Frontend tune the detection rules (W4437), train attendants on collusion-prevention, and handle internal-fraud per HR/legal (VS-103/VS-100)
Responsible (R): LP / Frontend / HR
Accountable (A): LP Lead / CHRO
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4449_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4449_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4449_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4449_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4449_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-92 (ensure self-checkout loss &amp; compliance control.) | - CTL-679: loss analytics run continuously; cases investigated with evidence; collusion-prevention trained; rules tuned; internal-fraud handled (VS-125)
Owner: Loss Prevention (VS-23) / Frontend (VS-08) / BI (VS-28)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
