    <bpmn:process id="W_W4450" name="W4450. SCO Exception, Video-Analytics &amp; Case Management" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: SCO exception (weight/override/error); loss case (W4449)
Frequency: Continuous (per exception/case)
Volume: SCO exceptions = flag/override/error rate × SCO volume
Owner: LP (VS-23) / Frontend (VS-08) / IT (VS-27)
Participants: LP (VS-23), Frontend (VS-08), IT (VS-27), Security (VS-27.3), HR (VS-103), Legal (VS-100)
Source: workflow W4450 — SCO Exception, Video-Analytics &amp; Case Management</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4450_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4450_Lane1" name="IT">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4450_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4450_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4450_Lane2" name="LP">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4450_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4450_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4450_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4450_Start4" name="SCO exception (weight/override/error); loss case (W4449)">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4450_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4450_Task5" name="IT/LP capture SCO exceptions (weight-mismatch, override, void, error…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: IT/LP capture SCO exceptions (weight-mismatch, override, void, error, exit-verify-fail) with auto-linked CCTV clip, into the exception/case system
Responsible (R): IT / LP
Accountable (A): LP Lead / IT Service Lead
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4450_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4450_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4450_Task6" name="LP triage exceptions — resolve routine (false-positive), investigate suspicious…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: LP triage exceptions — resolve routine (false-positive), investigate suspicious (W4449), and manage the case lifecycle (evidence, interview, action)
Responsible (R): LP
Accountable (A): LP Lead
Duration: Per case</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4450_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4450_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4450_Task7" name="LP/HR/Legal handle confirmed cases — recovery (civil/VS-100), employee action…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: LP/HR/Legal handle confirmed cases — recovery (civil/VS-100), employee action (VS-103/VS-84), customer/law-enforcement referral (VS-125), and feed learning to design (W4437)
Responsible (R): LP / HR / Legal
Accountable (A): LP Lead / CHRO / VP Legal
Duration: Per case</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4450_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4450_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4450_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4450_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4450_Annotation9">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-679 (ensure controlled execution — Loss Prevention, Cash, Compliance &amp; Analytics (PA-149.3).) | - CTL-679: exceptions captured with CCTV evidence; triaged &amp; investigated; cases resolved per policy; learning fed to design
Owner: LP (VS-23) / Frontend (VS-08) / IT (VS-27)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
