        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-679 (ensure controlled execution — Loss Prevention, Cash, Compliance &amp; Analytics (PA-149.3).) | - CTL-679: refund/void authorized per SoD; original validated; inventory/loyalty/tax reversed; anomalies investigated; reconciled
Owner: Frontend / Customer Service (VS-09/VS-32) / LP (VS-23)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
