    <bpmn:process id="W_W4452" name="W4452. SCO Cash Reconciliation, Variance &amp; Investigation" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Daily cash cycle (W4445); variance alert
Frequency: Daily + per variance
Volume: SCO cash across 200 stores × daily
Owner: Cash Office / Frontend (VS-08.2) / LP (VS-23) / Finance (VS-17)
Participants: Cash Office (VS-08.2), Frontend (VS-08), LP (VS-23), Finance (VS-17), Treasury (VS-18), Store Ops (VS-07)
Source: workflow W4452 — SCO Cash Reconciliation, Variance &amp; Investigation</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4452_LaneSet4">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4452_Lane1" name="Cash Office">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4452_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4452_Start5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4452_Lane2" name="LP">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4452_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4452_Lane3" name="Finance">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4452_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4452_End9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4452_Start5" name="Daily cash cycle (W4445); variance alert">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4452_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4452_Task6" name="Cash Office reconcile SCO cash (recycler + attendant drawer) to system tenders…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Cash Office reconcile SCO cash (recycler + attendant drawer) to system tenders daily, calculate variance, and log per terminal/attendant
Responsible (R): Cash Office / Frontend
